{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>That which grows of itself.</b> It is known that it is derived from ספחני נא; likewise נזירך is known to be derived from נזיר." "<b>Sabbath year.</b> The reason: for it is a sabbath year for the land, and the meaning is that the land is not under your authority in this year."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:16.914542832Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}